@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Identity binding and deduplication flow
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

start
:Validate current authority and reviewed intent;
:Establish actual identity/claim coordination;
if (Identity bound to different intent?) then (yes)
 :Safe identity conflict;
else (no)
 if (Recorded same-attempt result?) then (yes)
  :Return currently permitted result;
 else (no)
  if (Prior dispatch could have occurred?) then (yes)
   :Reconcile same attempt; retain unknown if evidence insufficient;
  else (no)
   :Dispatch only if current capability and effect contract permit;
   :Record actual observations under current claim guard;
  endif
 endif
endif
stop

@enduml
